d interagency coordination mechanisms within the Department of Justice.","evidence":"A task force, named program, or other similar structure to investigate and prosecute trade-related crimes... shall be established within the Criminal Division","evidence_verified":false,"key":"scope","score":50},{"assessment":"Establishes permanent organizational structures and ongoing annual reporting requirements to Congress.","evidence":"submit to the Committee on the Judiciary... not later than one year after the date of the enactment of this Act, and annually thereafter","evidence_verified":false,"key":"duration","score":60}],"missing_information":["Specific dollar amounts authorized for appropriations.","Exact number of new personnel positions to be created."],"rationale":"The bill establishes a specialized task force and support structure within the Department of Justice Criminal Division to investigate and prosecute trade-related crimes, creates new personnel positions, and requires annual reports to Congress, leading to moderate administrative and prosecutorial changes.","score":45},"importance_meta":{"generated_at":"2026-10-25T05:40:32+00:00","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","source_basis":"text+summary","source_urls":["https://www.congress.gov/119/bills/hr1869/BILLS-119hr1869eh.htm"]},"introduced_date":"2025-03-05","is_demo":false,"label":"H.R. 1869","latest_action":{"date":"2026-09-14","text":"Received in the Senate."},"members":[{"chamber":"House","district":"2","id":"H001091","name":"Rep. Hinson, Ashley","party":"R","role":"sponsor","state":"IA"},{"chamber":"House","date":"2025-03-05","district":"2","id":"M001194","name":"Rep. Moolenaar, John R.","original":true,"party":"R","role":"cosponsor","state":"MI"},{"chamber":"House","date":"2025-03-05","district":"8","id":"K000391","name":"Rep. Krishnamoorthi, Raja","original":true,"party":"D","role":"cosponsor","state":"IL"},{"chamber":"House","date":"2025-03-05","district":"1","id":"W000804","name":"Rep. Wittman, Robert J.","